BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_CooltrainerPaulIntro::
	.string "Your first battle against dragons?\p"
	.string "I’ll show you how tough they are!$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_CooltrainerPaulDefeat::
	.string "I’m disappointed.$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_CooltrainerPaul::
	.string "You’ve met LANCE, the dragon master?\n"
	.string "That just can’t be true.$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_CooltrainerMikeIntro::
	.string "My chance of losing?\n"
	.string "Not even one percent!$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_CooltrainerMikeDefeat::
	.string "That’s odd.$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_CooltrainerMike::
	.string "I know my shortcomings now.\n"
	.string "Thanks for showing me!$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_CooltrainerLolaIntro::
	.string "Dragons are sacred POKéMON.\p"
	.string "They are full of life energy.\p"
	.string "If you’re not serious, you won’t\n"
	.string "be able to beat them.$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_CooltrainerLolaDefeat::
	.string "Way to go!$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_CooltrainerLola::
	.string "Dragons are weak against dragon-\n"
	.string "type moves.$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_SabrinaIntro::
	.string "I am CLAIR. I’m the world’s best\n"
	.string "dragon master.\p"
	.string "I can hold my own against even the\n"
	.string "POKéMON LEAGUE’s ELITE FOUR.\p"
	.string "Do you still want to take me on?\p"
	.string "...Fine.\n"
	.string "Let’s do it!\p"
	.string "As a trainer, I will use my full\n"
	.string "power against any opponent!$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_SabrinaDefeat::
	.string "I lost?\p"
	.string "I don’t believe it. There must be\n"
	.string "some mistake...$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_Sabrina_1::
	.string "CLAIR: What’s the matter?\p"
	.string "This errand won’t be hard for you,\n"
	.string "unless your victory was a fluke.$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_Sabrina_2::
	.string "I won’t admit this.\p"
	.string "I may have lost, but you’re still\n"
	.string "not ready for the POKéMON LEAGUE.\p"
	.string "I know. You should take the dragon\n"
	.string "user challenge.\p"
	.string "Behind this GYM is a place called\n"
	.string "DRAGON’S DEN.\p"
	.string "Go and bring me the DRAGON FANG\n"
	.string "from deep inside the DEN.\p"
	.string "That is the test to be accepted as\n"
	.string "a true dragon user.\p"
	.string "If you can do that, I will\n"
	.string "accept you as a worthy trainer.\p"
	.string "Until then, I won’t give you a\n"
	.string "BADGE.$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "Yo! CHAMP in making!\p"
	.string "It’s been a long journey, but we\n"
	.string "are almost done!\l"
	.string "Count on me!\p"
	.string "CLAIR uses the mythical and\n"
	.string "sacred dragon-type POKéMON.\p"
	.string "You can’t damage them very easily.\p"
	.string "But you know, they’re supposed\n"
	.string "to be weak against ice-type moves.$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "You were great to beat CLAIR!\p"
	.string "All that’s left is the POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
	.string "challenge.\p"
	.string "You’re on the way to becoming the\n"
	.string "POKéMON CHAMPION!$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "BLACKTHORN CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: CLAIR\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "BLACKTHORN CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: CLAIR\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: {PLAYER} CARLOS$"

BlackthornCity_Interior7_Text_Sign1_3::
